#: About.qml:9
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Germanisches Nationalmuseum"
msgstr "Germanisches Nationalmuseum"

#: About.qml:14
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The original Behaim globe can be visited in the <a href=\"https://www.gnm.de/"
"\">Germanisches Nationalmuseum</a> in Nuremberg, Germany."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni Behaimov globus može se pogledati u muzeju <a href=\"https://www.gnm.de/\">Germanisches Nationalmuseum</a> u Nürnbergu u Njemačkoj."

#: About.qml:20
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Map Content"
msgstr "Sadržaj karte"

#: About.qml:25
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Digitized map based on orthophotographic gores by TU Vienna, 1990. "
"Germanisches Nationalmuseum and Friedrich-Alexander-Universität Erlangen-"
"Nürnberg, CC BY-SA 3.0. Ghillany map based on two planiglobes which are "
"provided as a map supplement to F.W. Ghillany's \"Geschichte des Seefahrers "
"Ritter Martin Behaim nach den ältesten vorhandenen Urkunden\", Nuremberg "
"1853. CC BY-SA 3.0."
msgstr ""
"Digitalizirana karta temeljena na ortofotografskim segmentima Sveučilišta u Beču, 1990. Germanisches Nationalmuseum i Friedrich-Alexander-Universität Erlangen-Nürnberg, CC BY-SA 3.0. Ghillanyjeva karta temelji se na dvjema planiglobama koje su priložene kao dodatak karti uz djelo F. W. Ghillanyja „Geschichte des Seefahrers Ritter Martin Behaim nach den ältesten vorhandenen Urkunden”, Nürnberg, 1853. CC BY-SA 3.0."

#: main.cpp:33
#, kde-format
msgid "Marble Behaim"
msgstr "Marble Behaim"

#: main.cpp:35
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Digital reproduction of a globe crafted at the time of Columbus' first sea "
"travel to the west."
msgstr "Digitalna reprodukcija globusa izrađenog u vrijeme Kolumbova prvog putovanja morem na zapad."

#: main.cpp:37
#, kde-format
msgid "© KDE Community"
msgstr "© Zajednica KDE-a"

#: main.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Martin Behaim's Erdapfel</p><p>The oldest existent globe of the Earth. "
"Martin Behaim and collaborators created the globe around 1492 at the time of "
"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyages_of_Christopher_Columbus"
"\">Columbus'</a> first sea travel to the west.Hence the American continent "
"is missing on this globe.Also note the detailed inscriptions in early modern "
"German.</p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erdapfel"
"\">Wikipedia: Erdapfel</a> for further information about the Behaim globe."
msgstr ""
"<p>Martin Behaimov Erdapfel</p><p>Najstariji sačuvani globus Zemlje. Martin Behaim i suradnici izradili su globus oko 1492., u vrijeme <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voyages_of_Christopher_Columbus\">Kolumbova</a> prvog putovanja morem na zapad. Stoga na ovom globusu nema američkog kontinenta. Obratite pozornost i na detaljne natpise na ranonovonjemačkom jeziku.</p><p>Za više informacija o Behaimovu globusu pogledajte <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erdapfel\">Wikipediju: Erdapfel</a>."

